                    r2_sync_hint:           `Number of live online cohort sessions across the 10 weeks. Synchronous rhythm builds momentum and relatedness.`,
                    r2_async_label:         `Self-paced asynchronous module build (the scalable backbone)`,
                    r2_social_label:        `Social-accountability layer — peer learning-circles & cohort milestones (€k)`,
                    r2_social_hint:         `€k into peer circles, milestone visibility and a light AI-tutor support layer — high engagement per euro for time-poor executives.`,
                    res_one:                `One two-day residential — an anchoring kick-off, then go online`,
                    res_two:                `Two residentials — open and close the programme in person`,
                    res_none:               `No residential — fully remote to protect cost-per-learner`,
                    async_balanced:         `A solid async backbone (€120k) that supports the live blend, not replaces it`,
                    async_full:             `A fully self-paced async build (€90k) and skip most live contact to save money`,
                    async_thin:             `A thin async layer (€60k) — lean on live contact for almost everything`,

                    r3_formative_label:     `How many low-stakes formative checks do you author? (€1.8k each)`,
                    r3_formative_hint:      `Frequent feedback-rich checks surface struggling learners early and build momentum — but every check costs €1.8k to author.`,
                    r3_placement_label:     `Where do you place the formative checks and momentum interventions?`,
                    r3_capstone_label:      `Sponsor-visible capstone (€22k to design & faculty-grade)`,
                    r3_evidence_label:      `How firmly do you build a backward-design outcome-evidence trail for EQUIS? (%)`,
