                    place_cliff:            `Concentrate density at the week 3–5 cliff — design follows the curve`,
                    place_even:             `Spread them evenly, one per week — tidy and fair across all 10 weeks`,
                    place_late:             `Back-load them near the end, close to the capstone`,
                    cap_both:               `A visible capstone PLUS the formative rhythm — early-warning and outcome evidence`,
                    cap_finalonly:          `A single high-stakes final exam only — cheap, what the faculty want`,
                    cap_none:               `No capstone — formative checks alone, save the €22k`,

                    r4_diagnosis_label:     `The pilot missed your projection. What is your diagnosis?`,
                    r4_realloc_label:       `Reallocate for v2 within €540k — where does the marginal euro go?`,
                    r4_outcome_label:       `Completion is recoverable — but how do you protect outcome attainment too?`,
                    r4_pitch_label:         `Pitch conviction: how firmly do you own the design miss to the Vice-Dean? (%)`,
                    diag_designmiss:        `A design fault — engagement collapsed exactly where the curve predicted and we placed nothing`,
                    diag_badluck:           `Bad luck — the pilot cohort was unusually busy this quarter`,
                    diag_learners:          `The learners again — executives just don't finish things like this`,
                    realloc_curve:          `Toward the diagnosed risk — momentum & accountability at the cliff, trim premium gloss`,
                    realloc_residential:    `Add another residential — more in-person always lifts engagement`,
                    realloc_flat:           `Keep v1 unchanged — the design was basically fine, just unlucky`,
                    out_joint:              `Engineer engagement AND outcomes jointly — applied tasks tied to real work, not just finishing`,
                    out_completion:         `Chase completion first — make it easier to finish, worry about learning later`,
                    out_rigour:             `Crank up rigour and a harder final — outcomes will follow even if completion dips`,

                    warn_focus_range:       `Diagnostic focus must be a percentage between 0 and 100.`,
